{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14303151","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14303151","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1430315101:1":{"text":"얼마 전에 제사장들이 여기서 내 아들을 끌고가서 처형했어.","source_cn":"我的儿子在前阵子被抓走，接着他就在这里，被祭司们处刑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9C1E417144EA50B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430315102:1":{"text":"대제사장님은 높으신 분이라 가까이 갈 수 없었지만, 그날 여기에 이 제사장이 있었던 건 똑똑히 기억해.","source_cn":"大祭司是大人物我遇不到，但我记得当时这位祭司也在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01530ABFF7F9ECC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430315103:1":{"text":"그래서, 내 아들이 대체 무슨 잘못을 해서 죽어야 했는지 물어보고 싶었어!","source_cn":"我就想问问，我的儿子到底犯了什么罪要被处死？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33ED2DEFDAC0C0AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:平民法拉尼":{"text":"평민 파라니","source":"平民法拉尼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}